    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d724">

                <pb facs="0769" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg719"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pera</hi> (<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Constantinople</hi>)</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-12-02"><hi rendition="#italic">December 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Information from British ambassador indicates far more loss of lives in Armenia
                    attended with atrocities than stated in my telegram of 28th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
